---
import SectionHeading from "./ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="experience" class="experience">
  <SectionHeading title="Experience" />

  <div class="timeline">
    <article class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-date">Present</div>

      <div class="timeline-content">
        <h3>IT Support Technician</h3>

        <p class="company">Managed Service Provider (MSP)</p>

        <p class="description">
          Day-to-day support for business clients across a mix of
          industries — Microsoft 365, networking, endpoint security, and
          whatever hardware or software problem lands in the ticket queue
          that day. Half the job is fixing things; the other half is
          documenting them well enough that the next person (or future me)
          doesn't have to start from scratch.
        </p>

        <ul class="responsibilities">
          <li>
            Administer Microsoft 365 — Exchange Online, Entra ID, and on-prem
            Active Directory, including the full onboarding/offboarding
            lifecycle and MFA.
          </li>
          <li>
            Troubleshoot Windows desktops, printers, hardware, and networking
            issues for business clients.
          </li>
          <li>Deploy and monitor endpoint security across client environments.</li>
          <li>
            Built and maintain a PowerShell toolkit (~20 scripts) for network
            discovery, system health checks, and security auditing.
          </li>
          <li>
            Provide remote support via NinjaOne, with documentation to keep
            the next ticket faster than the last.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tech-stack">
          <span>Microsoft 365</span>
          <span>Exchange Online</span>
          <span>Entra ID</span>
          <span>Active Directory</span>
          <span>PowerShell</span>
          <span>NinjaOne</span>
          <span>SentinelOne</span>
          <span>Guardz</span>
          <span>Barracuda</span>
          <span>Huntress</span>
          <span>SonicWall</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-date">Ongoing</div>

      <div class="timeline-content">
        <h3>Home Lab & Continuous Learning</h3>

        <p class="company">Personal Infrastructure Project</p>

        <p class="description">
          Everything I can't justify testing on a client's network gets
          tested here first. Proxmox host, VLAN-segmented network behind an
          OPNsense firewall, self-hosted services in Docker, and a growing
          PowerShell toolkit — all built, broken, and rebuilt on purpose.
        </p>

        <ul class="responsibilities">
          <li>
            Deploy and maintain a Proxmox environment running VMs, LXC
            containers, and Docker.
          </li>
          <li>
            Segmented the network into VLANs behind an OPNsense firewall,
            with zero downtime to existing Wi-Fi and media services.
          </li>
          <li>
            Self-host services — reverse proxy, dashboards, media server —
            documented and version-controlled on GitHub.
          </li>
          <li>
            Practice troubleshooting by intentionally testing and recovering
            from failures — most recently a DHCP reservation bug traced
            through live Kea logs.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tech-stack">
          <span>Proxmox VE</span>
          <span>Docker</span>
          <span>OPNsense</span>
          <span>VLANs</span>
          <span>Ubuntu Server</span>
          <span>Linux</span>
          <span>Nginx Proxy Manager</span>
          <span>PowerShell</span>
          <span>Git</span>
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .timeline-date {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: fit-content;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;

    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.25);

    color: var(--accent-light);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2.5rem;

    transition:
      border-color 0.25s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease,
      transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .timeline-content:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.18);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .company {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 2rem;

    color: var(--accent-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .description {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;

    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .responsibilities {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;

    list-style: none;
  }

  .responsibilities li {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    padding-left: 1.4rem;

    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .responsibilities li::before {
    content: "▹";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;

    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .tech-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tech-stack span {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;

    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.25);
    border-radius: 6px;

    color: var(--accent-light);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;

    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .tech-stack span:hover {
    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.2);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-lighter);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .experience {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .timeline-date {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .timeline-content {
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .description,
    .responsibilities {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
